#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A short guide on integrating Qiskit into an external provider's quantum "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Un guide succinct sur l'intégration de Qiskit dans les ressources quantiques"
" d'un fournisseur externe."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integrate external quantum resources with Qiskit"
msgstr "Intégrer des ressources quantiques externes avec Qiskit"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Integrate external quantum resources with Qiskit {#integrate-external-"
"quantum-resources-with-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Intégrer des ressources quantiques externes avec Qiskit {#integrate-"
"external-quantum-resources-with-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit SDK is built to support third parties in creating external "
"providers of quantum resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le SDK Qiskit est conçu pour permettre à des tiers de créer des fournisseurs"
" externes de ressources quantiques.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This means that any organization that develops or deploys quantum compute "
"resources can integrate their services into Qiskit and tap into its "
"userbase.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cela signifie que toute organisation qui développe ou déploie des ressources"
" de calcul quantique peut intégrer ses services dans Qiskit et profiter de "
"sa base d'utilisateurs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Doing so requires creating a package that supports requests for quantum "
"compute resources and returns them to the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour ce faire, il faut créer un package qui prend en charge les demandes de "
"ressources de calcul quantique et les retourne à l'utilisateur.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, the package must allow users to submit jobs and retrieve their"
" results through an implementation of the `qiskit.primitives` objects.\n"
msgstr ""
"De plus, le package doit permettre aux utilisateurs de soumettre des jobs et"
" de récupérer leurs résultats via une implémentation des objets "
"`qiskit.primitives`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Providing access to backends {#providing-access-to-backends}"
msgstr "Fournir l'accès aux backends {#providing-access-to-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order for users to transpile and execute `QuantumCircuit` objects using "
"external resources, they need to instantiate an object containing a "
"[`Target`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) which provides "
"information about a QPU's constraints such as its connectivity, basis gates,"
" and number of qubits. This can be provided through an interface similar to "
"the [`QiskitRuntimeService`](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-"
"service) through which a user can make requests for a QPU. This object "
"should, at minimum, contain a `Target`, but a simpler approach would be to "
"return a [`BackendV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour que les utilisateurs puissent transpiler et exécuter des objets "
"`QuantumCircuit` à l'aide de ressources externes, ils doivent instancier un "
"objet contenant un [`Target`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) qui "
"fournit des informations sur les contraintes d'un QPU, telles que sa "
"connectivité, ses portes de base et son nombre de qubits. Cela peut être "
"fourni via une interface similaire à [`QiskitRuntimeService`](../api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service), grâce à laquelle un utilisateur peut "
"faire des demandes pour un QPU. Cet objet doit, au minimum, contenir un "
"`Target`, mais une approche plus simple consiste à retourner une instance de"
" [`BackendV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "An example implementation may look something like:\n"
msgstr "Voici à quoi pourrait ressembler un exemple d'implémentation :\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Providing an interface for execution {#providing-an-interface-for-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Fournir une interface pour l'exécution {#providing-an-interface-for-"
"execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to providing a service returning hardware configurations, a "
"service providing access to external QPU resources also might also support "
"the execution of quantum workloads. Exposing that capability can be done by "
"creating implementations of the Qiskit primitives interfaces; for example "
"the [`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob), "
"[`BaseEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseEstimatorV2) and "
"[`BaseSamplerV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseSamplerV2) among "
"others. At minimum, these interfaces should be able to provide a method for "
"execution, querying job status, and returning the job results.\n"
msgstr ""
"En plus de fournir un service retournant les configurations matérielles, un "
"service donnant accès à des ressources QPU externes peut également prendre "
"en charge l'exécution de charges de travail quantiques. Exposer cette "
"capacité peut se faire en créant des implémentations des interfaces des "
"primitives Qiskit ; par exemple "
"[`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob), "
"[`BaseEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseEstimatorV2) et "
"[`BaseSamplerV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BaseSamplerV2), entre "
"autres. Ces interfaces doivent au minimum fournir une méthode pour "
"l'exécution, la consultation du statut du job et la récupération des "
"résultats du job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To handle job status and results, the Qiskit SDK provides a "
"[`DataBin`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin), "
"[`PubResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult), "
"[`PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult), and "
"[`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob) "
"objects should be used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour gérer le statut et les résultats des jobs, le SDK Qiskit fournit les "
"objets [`DataBin`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.DataBin), "
"[`PubResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult), "
"[`PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult) et "
"[`BasePrimitiveJob`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BasePrimitiveJob) à "
"utiliser.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the `qiskit.primitives` [API documentation](../api/qiskit/primitives) as"
" well as the reference implementations "
"[`BackendEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) "
"and [`BackendSampleV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) "
"for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Consulte la [documentation API](../api/qiskit/primitives) de "
"`qiskit.primitives` ainsi que les implémentations de référence "
"[`BackendEstimatorV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) "
"et [`BackendSampleV2`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2) "
"pour plus d'informations.\n"

